{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 3356020559307390030,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Rust codegen",
      "source_hash": 12245352215499595167,
      "context_hash": 17582850758622487980,
      "translation": "Rust 코드 생성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "codegen": "코드 생성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973236Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The first phase in debug info generation requires Rust to inspect the MIR of the program and communicate it to LLVM.",
      "source_hash": 16976798556608476287,
      "context_hash": 1053125095475293989,
      "translation": "디버그 정보 생성의 첫 번째 단계는 Rust가 프로그램의 MIR을 검사하여 이를 LLVM에 전달하는 것을 필요로 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973237Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This is primarily done in [`rustc_codegen_llvm/debuginfo`][llvm_di], though some type-name processing exists in [`rustc_codegen_ssa/debuginfo`][ssa_di].",
      "source_hash": 17762659516364686153,
      "context_hash": 770120090054351136,
      "translation": "이는 주로 [`rustc_codegen_llvm/debuginfo`][llvm_di]에서 이루어지지만, 일부 타입 이름 처리는 [`rustc_codegen_ssa/debuginfo`][ssa_di]에 존재합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973237Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Rust communicates to LLVM via the `DIBuilder` API, a thin wrapper around LLVM's internals that exists in [rustc_llvm].",
      "source_hash": 13696072036264739146,
      "context_hash": 15165285877289310162,
      "translation": "Rust는 `DIBuilder` API를 통해 LLVM에 전달하며, 이는 [rustc_llvm]에 존재하는 LLVM 내부에 대한 얇은 래퍼입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973237Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Type information",
      "source_hash": 2132403815158014356,
      "context_hash": 5524447030536857940,
      "translation": "타입 정보",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973237Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Type information typically consists of the type name, size, alignment, as well as things like fields, generic parameters, and storage modifiers if they are relevant.",
      "source_hash": 14100726707482641803,
      "context_hash": 2875737023567219719,
      "translation": "타입 정보는 일반적으로 타입 이름, 크기, 정렬은 물론, 필드, 제네릭 매개변수, 관련이 있는 경우 저장소 한정자와 같은 것들로 구성됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973237Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Much of this work happens in [rustc_codegen_llvm/src/debuginfo/metadata][di_metadata].",
      "source_hash": 5908168571301420777,
      "context_hash": 8816994716373840054,
      "translation": "이 작업의 대부분은 [rustc_codegen_llvm/src/debuginfo/metadata][di_metadata]에서 이루어집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973237Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "It is important to keep in mind that the goal is not necessarily \"represent types exactly how they appear in Rust\", rather it is to represent them in a way that allows debuggers to most accurately reconstruct the data during debugging.",
      "source_hash": 15640017685268332568,
      "context_hash": 17871592568052575411,
      "translation": "목표가 반드시 \"Rust에 나타나는 그대로 타입을 표현하는 것\"이 아니라, 디버깅 중 디버거가 데이터를 가장 정확하게 재구성할 수 있도록 표현하는 것임을 명심하는 것이 중요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973237Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "This distinction is vital to understanding the core work that occurs on this layer; many changes made here will be for the purpose of working around debugger limitations when no other option will work.",
      "source_hash": 13281394585262794435,
      "context_hash": 12323133456268529782,
      "translation": "이 구분은 이 계층에서 발생하는 핵심 작업을 이해하는 데 필수적입니다. 이곳에서 이루어지는 많은 변경 사항은 다른 방법이 통하지 않을 때 디버거의 한계를 우회하기 위한 목적으로 이루어집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973237Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Quirks",
      "source_hash": 11360930782095999483,
      "context_hash": 13601000445223239944,
      "translation": "특이 사항",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973237Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Rust's generated DI nodes \"pretend\" to be C/C++ for both CDB and LLDB's sake.",
      "source_hash": 7929937500322330291,
      "context_hash": 15080533469185516823,
      "translation": "Rust가 생성하는 DI 노드는 CDB와 LLDB 모두를 위해 C/C++인 \"척\"을 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973237Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This can result in some unintuitive and non-idiomatic debug info.",
      "source_hash": 4259539740238586892,
      "context_hash": 16854987381311302992,
      "translation": "이로 인해 다소 직관적이지 않고 관용적이지 않은 디버그 정보가 생성될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973237Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Pointers and references",
      "source_hash": 83391013704314333,
      "context_hash": 14829069394942958942,
      "translation": "포인터와 참조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973237Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Wide pointers/references/`Box` are treated as a struct with 2 fields: `data_ptr` and `length`.",
      "source_hash": 2662805825047741782,
      "context_hash": 1194323474999753413,
      "translation": "와이드 포인터/참조/`Box`는 `data_ptr`과 `length`라는 두 개의 필드를 가진 구조체로 취급됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973237Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "All non-wide pointers, references, and `Box` pointers are output as pointer nodes, and no distinction is made between `mut` and non-`mut`.",
      "source_hash": 5892785912394569044,
      "context_hash": 5217723185186009118,
      "translation": "와이드하지 않은 모든 포인터, 참조, `Box` 포인터는 포인터 노드로 출력되며, `mut`과 비`mut` 사이에 구분이 이루어지지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973237Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Several attempts have been made to rectify this, but unfortunately there is not a straightforward solution.",
      "source_hash": 10588561643872239889,
      "context_hash": 257647060903534733,
      "translation": "이를 바로잡기 위해 여러 차례 시도가 있었지만, 안타깝게도 간단한 해결책은 존재하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:2",
      "source": "Using the `reference` DI nodes of the respective formats has pitfalls.",
      "source_hash": 260701099824362295,
      "context_hash": 6690724205193579449,
      "translation": "각 형식의 `reference` DI 노드를 사용하는 데는 함정이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:3",
      "source": "There is a semantic difference between C++ references and Rust references that is unreconcilable.",
      "source_hash": 4261391288332143869,
      "context_hash": 14893529525379563832,
      "translation": "C++ 참조와 Rust 참조 사이에는 조정 불가능한 의미론적 차이가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "From [cppreference](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/reference.html):",
      "source_hash": 15641561318189580376,
      "context_hash": 10134149802693399921,
      "translation": "[cppreference](https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/language/reference.html)에서 발췌:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "References are not objects; **they do not necessarily occupy storage**, although the compiler may allocate storage if it is necessary to implement the desired semantics (e.g. a non-static data member of reference type usually increases the size of the class by the amount necessary to store a memory address).",
      "source_hash": 3930298635693765244,
      "context_hash": 6614538926303844980,
      "translation": "참조는 객체가 아니며, **반드시 저장소를 차지할 필요는 없습니다**. 다만 원하는 의미론을 구현하는 데 필요한 경우 컴파일러가 저장소를 할당할 수 있습니다(예를 들어, 참조 타입의 비정적 데이터 멤버는 일반적으로 메모리 주소를 저장하는 데 필요한 만큼 클래스의 크기를 증가시킵니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "compiler": "컴파일러"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Because references are not objects, **there are no arrays of references, no pointers to references, and no references to references**",
      "source_hash": 15749367341801234871,
      "context_hash": 10820833846876818913,
      "translation": "참조는 객체가 아니기 때문에, **참조의 배열도, 참조에 대한 포인터도, 참조에 대한 참조도 존재하지 않습니다**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "The current proposed solution is to simply [typedef the pointer nodes].",
      "source_hash": 14679155803703324271,
      "context_hash": 132022009241695191,
      "translation": "현재 제안된 해결책은 단순히 [포인터 노드를 typedef하는 것](typedef the pointer nodes)입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Using the `const` qualifier to denote non-`mut` poses potential issues due to LLDB's internal optimizations.",
      "source_hash": 14977375205238622367,
      "context_hash": 10693534948098605331,
      "translation": "`const` 한정자를 사용하여 비`mut`을 나타내는 것은 LLDB의 내부 최적화로 인해 잠재적인 문제를 일으킬 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "In short, LLDB attempts to cache the child-values of variables (e.g. struct fields, array elements) when stepping through code.",
      "source_hash": 10763662121138835730,
      "context_hash": 11143953086628610251,
      "translation": "간단히 말해, LLDB는 코드를 단계별로 실행할 때 변수의 자식 값(예: 구조체 필드, 배열 요소)을 캐시하려고 시도합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:2",
      "source": "A heuristic is used to determine which values are safely cache-able, and `const` is part of that heuristic.",
      "source_hash": 11008521021574313790,
      "context_hash": 17183305864859345309,
      "translation": "어떤 값이 안전하게 캐시될 수 있는지를 결정하는 데 휴리스틱이 사용되며, `const`는 그 휴리스틱의 일부입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:3",
      "source": "Research has not been done into how this would interact with things like Rust's interior mutability constructs.",
      "source_hash": 11276270072696898184,
      "context_hash": 9116962333581427386,
      "translation": "이것이 Rust의 내부 가변성 구조체와 같은 것들과 어떻게 상호작용할지에 대한 연구는 이루어지지 않았습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "DWARF vs PDB",
      "source_hash": 4011646405887445045,
      "context_hash": 9893856809261971485,
      "translation": "DWARF 대 PDB",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "While most of the type information is fairly straight forward, one notable issue is the debug info format of the target.",
      "source_hash": 14475079534303746328,
      "context_hash": 2689226807712474828,
      "translation": "대부분의 타입 정보는 상당히 직관적이지만, 한 가지 주목할 만한 문제는 대상의 디버그 정보 형식입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:11/seg:1",
      "source": "Each format has different semantics and limitations, as such they require slightly different debug info in some cases.",
      "source_hash": 6076715899577792160,
      "context_hash": 5837853089648379726,
      "translation": "각 형식은 서로 다른 의미론과 한계를 가지고 있으며, 이 때문에 일부 경우에는 약간 다른 디버그 정보가 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:11/seg:2",
      "source": "This is gated by calls to [`cpp_like_debuginfo`].",
      "source_hash": 554948879465290320,
      "context_hash": 13166095014107977371,
      "translation": "이는 [`cpp_like_debuginfo`] 호출에 의해 게이팅됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973238Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Naming",
      "source_hash": 2665270351651321507,
      "context_hash": 4287559584073048469,
      "translation": "이름 지정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973239Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Rust attempts to communicate type names as accurately as possible, but debuggers and debug info formats do not always respect that.",
      "source_hash": 11719966088622896412,
      "context_hash": 261035181927752800,
      "translation": "Rust는 타입 이름을 가능한 한 정확하게 전달하려고 시도하지만, 디버거와 디버그 정보 형식이 항상 이를 존중하지는 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:55.973239Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:14/seg:0",
      "source": "Due to limitations in MSVC's expression parser, the following name transformations are made for PDB debug info:",
      "source_hash": 8869791067741416483,
      "context_hash": 9908194789768614464,
      "translation": "MSVC의 표현식 파서에 있는 제약으로 인해, PDB 디버그 정보에 대해 다음과 같은 이름 변환이 이루어집니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:43.287184Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Rust name",
      "source_hash": 14536265082781921632,
      "context_hash": 8705139718760242328,
      "translation": "Rust 이름",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:43.287186Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "MSVC name",
      "source_hash": 10535852926240246542,
      "context_hash": 14387574200292905089,
      "translation": "MSVC 이름",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:43.287186Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "`&str`/`&mut str`",
      "source_hash": 13649460442036975540,
      "context_hash": 16175177619487689569,
      "translation": "`&str`/`&mut str`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:43.287187Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "`ref$<str$>`/`ref_mut$<str$>`",
      "source_hash": 9350688124215691235,
      "context_hash": 3542314981403503600,
      "translation": "`ref$<str$>`/`ref_mut$<str$>`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:43.287187Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "`&[T]`/`&mut [T]`",
      "source_hash": 15394804802279689330,
      "context_hash": 12642010845816399941,
      "translation": "`&[T]`/`&mut [T]`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:43.287188Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:20/seg:0",
      "source": "`ref$<slice$<T> >`/`ref_mut$<slice$<T> >`[^1]",
      "source_hash": 5446297067750020057,
      "context_hash": 2371591993623613178,
      "translation": "`ref$<slice$<T> >`/`ref_mut$<slice$<T> >`[^1]",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:14:43.287188Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:21/seg:0",
      "source": "`[T; N]`",
