    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:45/seg:0",
      "source": "MSVC's expression parser will treat `>>` as a right shift.",
      "source_hash": 11708155488430041131,
      "context_hash": 7051429206640335973,
      "translation": "MSVC의 표현식 파서는 `>>`를 오른쪽 시프트로 취급합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582678Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:45/seg:1",
      "source": "It is necessary to separate consecutive `>`'s with a space (`> >`) in type names.",
      "source_hash": 14917598695426627054,
      "context_hash": 3603034435794862400,
      "translation": "타입 이름에서는 연속된 `>`를 공백(`> >`)으로 구분해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582678Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:46/seg:0",
      "source": "While these type names are generated as part of the debug info node (which is then wrapped in a typedef node with the Rust name), once the LLVM-IR node is converted to a CodeView node, the type name information is lost.",
      "source_hash": 8393788347194208232,
      "context_hash": 3321356524962306125,
      "translation": "이러한 타입 이름은 디버그 정보 노드의 일부로 생성되며(이후 Rust 이름을 가진 typedef 노드로 감싸집니다), LLVM-IR 노드가 CodeView 노드로 변환되면 타입 이름 정보가 손실됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582678Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:46/seg:1",
      "source": "This is because CodeView has special shorthand nodes for primitive types, and those shorthand nodes to not have a \"name\" field.",
      "source_hash": 5677946768014897392,
      "context_hash": 6617754597254145455,
      "translation": "이는 CodeView가 기본 타입에 대해 특별한 축약 노드를 가지고 있고, 이러한 축약 노드에는 \"name\" 필드가 없기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582678Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:47/seg:0",
      "source": "Generics",
      "source_hash": 3963238951086830962,
      "context_hash": 10728647104706028833,
      "translation": "제네릭",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582678Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:48/seg:0",
      "source": "Rust outputs generic *type* information (`T` in `ArrayVec<T, N: usize>`), but not generic *value* information (`N` in `ArrayVec<T, N: usize>`).",
      "source_hash": 12418386918627807449,
      "context_hash": 3750475322743404107,
      "translation": "Rust는 제네릭 *타입* 정보(`ArrayVec<T, N: usize>`의 `T`)는 출력하지만, 제네릭 *값* 정보(`ArrayVec<T, N: usize>`의 `N`)는 출력하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582679Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:49/seg:0",
      "source": "CodeView does not have a leaf node for generics/C++ templates, so all generic information is lost when generating PDB debug info.",
      "source_hash": 16133281774075854694,
      "context_hash": 6408292800548868265,
      "translation": "CodeView에는 제네릭/C++ 템플릿을 위한 리프 노드가 없기 때문에, PDB 디버그 정보를 생성할 때 모든 제네릭 정보가 손실됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582679Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:49/seg:1",
      "source": "There are workarounds that allow the debugger to retrieve the generic arguments via the type name, but it is fragile solution at best.",
      "source_hash": 8363057516393656827,
      "context_hash": 18118314795345133722,
      "translation": "디버거가 타입 이름을 통해 제네릭 인수를 가져올 수 있게 하는 우회 방법이 있지만, 이는 기껏해야 취약한 해결책일 뿐입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582679Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:49/seg:2",
      "source": "Efforts are being made to contact Microsoft to correct this deficiency, and/or to use one of the unused CodeView node types as a suitable equivalent.",
      "source_hash": 16582074254116203364,
      "context_hash": 5010465803982738602,
      "translation": "이 결함을 바로잡기 위해 Microsoft에 연락하거나, 사용되지 않는 CodeView 노드 유형 중 하나를 적절한 대안으로 사용하려는 노력이 진행 중입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582679Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:50/seg:0",
      "source": "Type aliases",
      "source_hash": 7275856481773304009,
      "context_hash": 5004532008874598301,
      "translation": "타입 별칭",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582679Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:51/seg:0",
      "source": "Rust outputs typedef nodes in several cases to help account for debugger limitiations, but it does not currently output nodes for [type aliases in the source code][type_aliases].",
      "source_hash": 13651322835809291257,
      "context_hash": 3449997981246347700,
      "translation": "Rust는 디버거의 한계를 보완하기 위해 여러 경우에 typedef 노드를 출력하지만, [소스 코드의 타입 별칭][type_aliases]에 대해서는 현재 노드를 출력하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582679Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:52/seg:0",
      "source": "Enums",
      "source_hash": 2898812422319610043,
      "context_hash": 12858922830457456131,
      "translation": "열거형",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582679Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:53/seg:0",
      "source": "Enum DI nodes are generated in [rustc_codegen_llvm/src/debuginfo/metadata/enums][di_metadata_enums]",
      "source_hash": 10528557212319389704,
      "context_hash": 16554841734622472122,
      "translation": "열거형 DI 노드는 [rustc_codegen_llvm/src/debuginfo/metadata/enums][di_metadata_enums]에서 생성됩니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582679Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:54/seg:0",
      "source": "DWARF",
      "source_hash": 10493194260667048382,
      "context_hash": 11800129611599584333,
      "translation": "DWARF",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582680Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:55/seg:0",
      "source": "DWARF has a dedicated node for discriminated unions: `DW_TAG_variant`.",
      "source_hash": 17338664490603878357,
      "context_hash": 13559834774614015498,
      "translation": "DWARF에는 판별 유니온을 위한 전용 노드인 `DW_TAG_variant`가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582680Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:55/seg:1",
      "source": "It is a container that references `DW_TAG_variant_part` nodes that may or may not contain a discriminant value.",
      "source_hash": 15748782970594601624,
      "context_hash": 5635088438587409241,
      "translation": "이는 판별값을 포함할 수도 있고 포함하지 않을 수도 있는 `DW_TAG_variant_part` 노드를 참조하는 컨테이너입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582680Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:55/seg:2",
      "source": "The hierarchy looks as follows:",
      "source_hash": 2855674474432251906,
      "context_hash": 5052615908648710648,
      "translation": "계층 구조는 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582680Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:57/seg:0",
      "source": "PDB",
      "source_hash": 15967130963871465544,
      "context_hash": 8249960241817613061,
      "translation": "PDB",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582680Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:58/seg:0",
      "source": "PDB does not have a dedicated node, so it generates the C equivalent of a discriminated union:",
      "source_hash": 3909154932144799003,
      "context_hash": 2563677937547507973,
      "translation": "PDB에는 전용 노드가 없기 때문에, 판별 유니온에 해당하는 C 등가물을 생성합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582680Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:60/seg:0",
      "source": "An important note is that due to limitations in LLDB, the `DISCR_*` value generated is always a `u64` even if the value is not `#[repr(u64)]`.",
      "source_hash": 942487805416900580,
      "context_hash": 8315249476575081337,
      "translation": "중요한 점은, LLDB의 한계로 인해 생성되는 `DISCR_*` 값이 `#[repr(u64)]`가 아니더라도 항상 `u64`라는 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582680Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:60/seg:1",
      "source": "This is largely a non-issue for LLDB because the `DISCR_*` value and the `tag` are read into `uint64_t` values regardless of their type.",
      "source_hash": 16815292478113029149,
      "context_hash": 6467496824836146201,
      "translation": "이는 LLDB에서 `DISCR_*` 값과 `tag`가 타입에 관계없이 `uint64_t` 값으로 읽히기 때문에 대체로 문제가 되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582680Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Source information",
      "source_hash": 10876908994169021041,
      "context_hash": 4367095510615257672,
      "translation": "소스 정보",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T01:05:55.582680Z",
      "issues": []
